WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.720
Take the DNA from just one of your cells,

2
00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:05.380
and stretch it out, end to end.

3
00:00:05.430 --> 00:00:08.650
Laid out like that, it
would stand taller than you.

4
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.080
Now fit all of it inside a single nucleus.

5
00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.970
And it can't just be stuffed in.

6
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:18.100
It must be moved without
tangling, copied, and read.

7
00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:21.930
So how does all that DNA
fit inside the nucleus?

8
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:26.170
In this mission, you'll find out
what a chromosome is really made of.

9
00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:31.170
Then you'll compare a chromosome between
divisions with one that's about to divide.

10
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:36.220
Your mission: find out how DNA that
would stand taller than you fits inside a

11
00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.150
nucleus.
